01:58:43,200 --> 01:58:46,000
Open it at your feet

2450
01:58:46,000 --> 01:58:47,800
The top is... Red Real

2451
01:58:47,800 --> 01:58:50,800
Was it just making a hole?

2452
01:58:50,800 --> 01:58:54,670
Go up with this

2453
01:58:55,470 --> 01:58:59,200
What happened after that? Luna—

2454
01:58:59,200 --> 01:59:01,870
What are we supposed to do next?

2455
01:59:01,870 --> 01:59:03,670
Right, exactly

2456
01:59:03,670 --> 01:59:04,670
Oh, wait

2457
01:59:04,670 --> 01:59:06,670
What the heck, sorry!

2458
01:59:06,670 --> 01:59:09,470
We'll keep going until we die

2459
01:59:09,470 --> 01:59:11,270
We'll do it even if we die

2460
01:59:11,270 --> 01:59:15,270
Wait, does this part actually need Unatan after all?

2461
01:59:15,270 --> 01:59:24,010
There's a white one below

2462
01:59:24,010 --> 01:59:29,810
From above — fall! Use the falling speed

2463
01:59:29,810 --> 01:59:30,970
Did you think of something?

2464
01:59:30,970 --> 01:59:34,540
Then, here and — where do we connect it?

2465
01:59:34,540 --> 01:59:35,010
It's been destroyed

2466
01:59:35,010 --> 01:59:36,810
Up?

2467
01:59:36,810 --> 01:59:41,170
With this?

2468
01:59:41,170 --> 01:59:42,970
Huh?

2469
01:59:42,970 --> 01:59:46,610
Wait, what?

2470
01:59:46,610 --> 01:59:49,500
Wait, Popo's not hitting it, is she

2471
01:59:49,500 --> 01:59:52,220
The position is different from before

2472
01:59:52,220 --> 01:59:54,100
Around here, a little

2473
01:59:54,100 --> 01:59:55,770
Really?

2474
01:59:55,770 --> 01:59:59,570
Oh, how was it? Here, right?

2475
01:59:59,570 --> 02:00:01,370
Like this, right?

2476
02:00:01,370 --> 02:00:04,170
Then go up from here

2477
02:00:04,170 --> 02:00:09,630
and connect here to over there, right?

2478
02:00:09,630 --> 02:00:13,140
Here and

2479
02:00:13,140 --> 02:00:14,940
Ha!

2480
02:00:14,940 --> 02:00:19,750
Doesn't Bolt have to be the one to make the laser?

2481
02:00:22,550 --> 02:00:24,950
- How is it? Different? - Huh, wait?

2482
02:00:24,950 --> 02:00:28,620
What are we supposed to do here?

2483
02:00:28,620 --> 02:00:32,720
How does the laser work again?

2484
02:00:32,720 --> 02:00:39,570
- Is it wrong? - The laser is Popo's?

2485
02:00:39,570 --> 02:00:42,570
Polka makes the laser,

2486
02:00:42,570 --> 02:00:46,970
and Luna makes the one below it.

2487
02:00:46,970 --> 02:00:48,970
Will this work?

2488
02:00:48,970 --> 02:00:51,570
Broke it again!

2489
02:00:51,570 --> 02:00:53,570
It's so flimsy, come on...

2490
02:00:53,570 --> 02:00:59,370
There's a combo, and Unatan can do it with the yellow and red ones?

2491
02:00:59,370 --> 02:01:03,180
Here we go!

2492
02:01:03,180 --> 02:01:04,980
Go Luna!

2493
02:01:04,980 --> 02:01:06,780
Oh, sorry! Are you okay?

2494
02:01:06,780 --> 02:01:09,630
Huh? Where did this come from?

2495
02:01:09,630 --> 02:01:11,580
Did something go somewhere?

2496
02:01:11,580 --> 02:01:14,180
Where is this?

2497
02:01:14,180 --> 02:01:15,980
Where?

2498
02:01:15,980 --> 02:01:17,780
Wait, is that the exit?

2499
02:01:17,780 --> 02:01:19,580
Huh? What?

2500
02:01:19,580 --> 02:01:21,580
It's on the other side of the laser?

2501
02:01:21,580 --> 02:01:23,380
Oh, the laser stopped.

2502
02:01:23,380 --> 02:01:25,800
It stopped — Unaotан is way back there.

2503
02:01:25,800 --> 02:01:27,840
Hello~

2504
02:01:27,840 --> 02:01:31,700
She made it — how did you get all the way here, Unaotan?

2505
02:01:31,700 --> 02:01:36,690
Maybe she pressed that button up top?

2506
02:01:36,690 --> 02:01:38,910
Oh, oh, wait?

2507
02:01:38,910 --> 02:01:41,250
She probably pressed it with her body.

2508
02:01:41,250 --> 02:01:43,330
She pressed it while she was in between.

2509
02:01:43,330 --> 02:01:47,330
I have no memory of this place.

2510
02:01:47,330 --> 02:01:52,260
- Should we use that square? - We're moving forward!

2511
02:01:52,260 --> 02:01:56,140
- Are we done with that square? I wonder. - Hmm...

2512
02:01:56,140 --> 02:01:59,820
Hmm... how's it looking so far?

2513
02:01:59,820 --> 02:02:03,220
- Oh! It opened! - It opened!

2514
02:02:03,220 --> 02:02:06,680
Just for a moment! It was just a moment!

2515
02:02:06,680 --> 02:02:10,360
- Then what are we supposed to do?! - Make one here then.

2516
02:02:10,360 --> 02:02:13,540
- Bobo flies... - Flying~

2517
02:02:13,540 --> 02:02:15,540
Maybe we can get over there?

2518
02:02:15,540 --> 02:02:16,540
Oh, a little off.

2519
02:02:16,540 --> 02:02:22,130
There's a Popo!

2520
02:02:22,130 --> 02:02:25,810
Open it.

2521
02:02:25,810 --> 02:02:28,610
Hmm, there's no spot to make a hole here.

2522
02:02:28,610 --> 02:02:29,610
Huh?

2523
02:02:29,610 --> 02:02:31,410
Wait a second.

2524
02:02:31,410 --> 02:02:35,210
So we're not supposed to punch a hole through this way?

2525
02:02:35,210 --> 02:02:37,010
What?

2526
02:02:37,010 --> 02:02:41,720
Oh no, I can't get back.

2527
02:02:41,720 --> 02:02:43,720
I can't get back!

2528
02:02:43,720 --> 02:02:46,380
Oh no, Polka needs to jump and help.

2529
02:02:46,380 --> 02:02:48,480
Okay!

2530
02:02:48,480 --> 02:02:49,840
Okay!

2531
02:02:49,840 --> 02:02:52,280
Open it.

2532
02:02:52,280 --> 02:02:52,980
Ahh!

2533
02:02:52,980 --> 02:02:55,060
Aww, so close.

2534
02:02:55,060 --> 02:02:56,420
Wait, wait.

2535
02:02:56,420 --> 02:02:57,780
How do we deal with Popo...

2536
02:02:57,780 --> 02:02:59,660
So we do bring the box after all.

2537
02:02:59,660 --> 02:03:03,650
Oh, we launch the box?

2538
02:03:03,650 --> 02:03:05,990
And then we rush through in the meantime?

2539
02:03:05,990 --> 02:03:07,870
Ah, okay then.

2540
02:03:07,870 --> 02:03:09,730
Wait, why are you coming from this side?

2541
02:03:09,730 --> 02:03:11,030
Oh, because she respawned.

2542
02:03:11,370 --> 02:03:13,370
When you respawn you go back to the start.

2543
02:03:13,370 --> 02:03:14,370
That's scary.

2544
02:03:14,370 --> 02:03:18,020
Holy moly.

2545
02:03:18,020 --> 02:03:20,820
So we sacrifice her?

2546
02:03:20,820 --> 02:03:26,580
Okay, here we go.

2547
02:03:26,580 --> 02:03:30,580
What is Polka supposed to do here?

2548
02:03:30,580 --> 02:03:32,580
I'm not going to make it in time at all.

2549
02:03:32,580 --> 02:03:38,380
The door closed right in front of me.

2550
02:03:46,220 --> 02:03:48,820
There's no way I'll make it.

2551
02:03:48,820 --> 02:03:52,080
Just jumping on my own won't work.

2552
02:03:52,080 --> 02:03:53,520
Even if I jump, probably...

2553
02:03:53,520 --> 02:03:55,520
Go!

2554
02:03:55,520 --> 02:03:57,220
Not gonna make it.

2555
02:03:57,220 --> 02:03:58,060
What is this?

2556
02:03:58,060 --> 02:04:01,700
We can't make a portal over there, right?

2557
02:04:01,700 --> 02:04:03,240
There's nothing on this side, so...

2558
02:04:03,240 --> 02:04:07,360
Maybe we use that white wall on the other side somehow?

2559
02:04:07,360 --> 02:04:11,810
How do we use this?

2560
02:04:11,810 --> 02:04:13,480
I mean, somehow...

2561
02:04:13,480 --> 02:04:15,780
Just kind of...

2562
02:04:15,780 --> 02:04:18,780
Wait, does sliding down like that mean something?

2563
02:04:18,780 --> 02:04:28,960
No, that's not it... what is it?

2564
02:04:28,960 --> 02:04:36,560
Maybe use the momentum from this jump?

2565
02:04:36,560 --> 02:04:45,730
What did the cube do again?

2566
02:04:45,730 --> 02:04:48,730
Or maybe open a hole here,

2567
02:04:48,730 --> 02:04:55,810
launch the cube through here,

2568
02:04:56,610 --> 02:04:57,610
go this way,

2569
02:04:57,610 --> 02:04:59,170
and hop over—

2570
02:04:59,170 --> 02:05:00,790
like that?

2571
02:05:00,790 --> 02:05:05,410
Why? That move is so hard!

2572
02:05:05,410 --> 02:05:06,410
Thanks, but...

2573
02:05:06,410 --> 02:05:08,670
Well, that's probably how it goes.

2574
02:05:08,670 --> 02:05:09,950
Once you place it, it goes through the hole

2575
02:05:09,950 --> 02:05:10,950
and flies together!

2576
02:05:10,950 --> 02:05:12,170
They flew together!

2577
02:05:12,170 --> 02:05:17,670
The ball can't fly, the ball can't fly through!

2578
02:05:17,670 --> 02:05:20,070
Open the hole, place it, there, like this.

2579
02:05:20,070 --> 02:05:21,070
Yes! Thank you!

2580
02:05:21,070 --> 02:05:22,070
Thank you!

2581
02:05:22,070 --> 02:05:24,570
Not sure if that was right, but...

2582
02:05:24,570 --> 02:05:26,570
Well, if you reach the goal, you win!

2583
02:05:26,570 --> 02:05:27,770
Yay!

2584
02:05:27,770 --> 02:05:30,770
Are there different ways to do this? Smart people would—

2585
02:05:30,770 --> 02:05:31,270
That's amazing.

2586
02:05:31,270 --> 02:05:33,770
Are there? Wait, are there other ways?

2587
02:05:33,770 --> 02:05:38,510
That was a brilliant clutch moment.

2588
02:05:38,510 --> 02:05:39,510
Woo!

2589
02:05:39,510 --> 02:05:43,310
Ugh, well, it's tough.

2590
02:05:43,310 --> 02:05:47,110
Well, let's stop here for today, shall we?

2591
02:05:47,110 --> 02:05:51,110
We cleared exactly 7 and 7, right? 7 and 7.

2592
02:05:51,110 --> 02:05:51,610
It's fine, are you ready?

2593
02:05:51,610 --> 02:05:53,110
How far does this go?

2594
02:05:53,110 --> 02:05:55,110
It's totally fine, right?

2595
02:05:55,110 --> 02:05:58,020
I don't know, even Polka doesn't know how far it goes.

2596
02:05:58,020 --> 02:06:00,910
No idea.

2597
02:06:00,910 --> 02:06:03,910
I mean, this is my first time here too.

2598
02:06:03,910 --> 02:06:07,710
The area has changed again.

2599
02:06:07,710 --> 02:06:09,710
How do we get through?

2600
02:06:09,710 --> 02:06:12,510
Maybe we just shoot randomly again?

2601
02:06:12,510 --> 02:06:14,310
What's this?

2602
02:06:14,310 --> 02:06:17,110
Looks like there's somewhere we can shoot.

2603
02:06:17,110 --> 02:06:20,110
Wait, did we say we'd try shooting randomly earlier?

2604
02:06:21,910 --> 02:06:24,910
Starting with a drill press, that's hilarious.

2605
02:06:24,910 --> 02:06:27,510
Oh, you can build here.

2606
02:06:27,510 --> 02:06:29,510
Oh, you could go this way?

2607
02:06:29,510 --> 02:06:31,310
Hey, stop doing random stuff.

2608
02:06:31,310 --> 02:06:33,310
You could go there? Stop it.

2609
02:06:33,310 --> 02:06:35,110
See?

2610
02:06:35,110 --> 02:06:36,910
Spray and pray.

2611
02:06:36,910 --> 02:06:39,570
I think you can get somewhere from here.

2612
02:06:39,570 --> 02:06:40,510
Oh, you can build here.

2613
02:06:40,510 --> 02:06:43,510
I can do 1-1, but...

2614
02:06:43,510 --> 02:06:48,120
2-2...

2615
02:06:48,120 --> 02:06:50,920
What about 2-2-2-2?

2616
02:06:51,720 --> 02:06:57,320
1-1-1 and 2-1-2...

2617
02:06:57,320 --> 02:06:59,320
If these connect, where do they go?

2618
02:06:59,320 --> 02:07:01,120
Hmm, it comes here.

2619
02:07:01,120 --> 02:07:01,920
Hello there.

2620
02:07:01,920 --> 02:07:04,180
I'm getting stuck.

2621
02:07:04,180 --> 02:07:08,180
Not enough momentum here.

2622
02:07:08,180 --> 02:07:11,770
Oh, there's one here too?

2623
02:07:11,770 --> 02:07:13,730
Oh, you're right.

2624
02:07:18,700 --> 02:07:22,500
Oh, looks like you can go down too.

2625
02:07:22,500 --> 02:07:25,300
Oh, really! Ow!

2626
02:07:25,300 --> 02:07:29,020
Oh, there was some momentum just now, something below—

2627
02:07:29,020 --> 02:07:31,900
Where are you going? Come on, you.

2628
02:07:31,900 --> 02:07:36,700
So where do we go from here? What's the right path?

2629
02:07:36,700 --> 02:07:37,500
Is it here?

2630
02:07:37,500 --> 02:07:38,500
This...

2631
02:07:38,500 --> 02:07:39,470
2.

2632
02:07:39,470 --> 02:07:40,300
Like, 2?

2633
02:07:40,300 --> 02:07:43,300
2 or 1, then enter this spot.

2634
02:07:43,300 --> 02:07:45,300
You go in? Wait, do you press this button?

2635
02:07:45,300 --> 02:08:16,320
Whooooooa!

2636
02:08:16,320 --> 02:08:23,720
Get Flow? Gel Flow? Jel Flow?

2637
02:08:23,720 --> 02:08:29,140
Jel Flow? Gel Flow?

2638
02:08:29,140 --> 02:08:32,720
So?

2639
02:08:32,720 --> 02:08:36,540
Maybe it's not 2nd — is 1st the right one?

2640
02:08:36,540 --> 02:08:39,340
Is there an order to it?

2641
02:08:39,340 --> 02:08:43,140
They've got a cube over there, but there's nowhere to put it.

2642
02:08:43,140 --> 02:08:49,750
Yeah, true. The cube is like, "I'm doing something!" kind of vibe.

2643
02:08:49,750 --> 02:08:52,750
Hmm, how do we get back from here?

2644
02:08:52,750 --> 02:08:55,750
This one doesn't really have anything special, right?

2645
02:08:55,750 --> 02:09:06,230
Oh, there's a red button! Oh, there IS a red button!

2646
02:09:06,230 --> 02:09:12,830
There is. I was wondering if we should press it. If we do it from number 1, we press it. We have to start from 1.

2647
02:09:12,830 --> 02:09:17,370
Over there — okay, let's try matching them up.

2648
02:09:17,370 --> 02:09:21,730
I pressed the restart button.

2649
02:09:21,730 --> 02:09:27,950
Oh wait, the time — the time — what? It's going to run out over there!

2650
02:09:27,950 --> 02:09:31,550
Oh, some kind of timer.

2651
02:09:31,550 --> 02:09:37,190
Right, so after doing number 1, what changed? I don't know.

2652
02:09:37,190 --> 02:09:41,570
I don't know. Let me check. Press here.

2653
02:09:41,570 --> 02:09:49,290
I wonder if something opens... something went up! That ball that's been flowing this whole time—

2654
02:09:49,290 --> 02:09:53,080
—started going downward.

2655
02:09:53,080 --> 02:09:58,980
You see that? Wait, is it the same as before? Just for a moment earlier—

2656
02:09:58,980 --> 02:10:02,520
—it went up. Which means—

2657
02:10:02,520 --> 02:10:05,260
—they both launch at the same time!

2658
02:10:05,260 --> 02:10:07,080
They pop out — boing!

2659
02:10:07,080 --> 02:10:11,020
So we do the same thing as before again?

2660
02:10:11,020 --> 02:10:13,020
We do what we did earlier.

2661
02:10:13,020 --> 02:10:15,090
Ow!

2662
02:10:15,090 --> 02:10:18,090
I see, so you go boing boing to number 2.

2663
02:10:18,090 --> 02:10:20,990
Jump!

2664
02:10:20,990 --> 02:10:22,610
Where'd you go?

2665
02:10:22,610 --> 02:10:23,490
Number 2.

2666
02:10:23,490 --> 02:10:25,290
Not there.

2667
02:10:25,290 --> 02:10:27,290
Okay, let's do it together then.

2668
02:10:28,590 --> 02:10:33,910
So Bonatan went 1-1 and bounced over, right?

2669
02:10:33,910 --> 02:10:35,910
Here, yeah.

2670
02:10:35,910 --> 02:10:36,870
Alright.

2671
02:10:36,870 --> 02:10:38,150
Here we go!

2672
02:10:38,150 --> 02:10:39,750
Okay, wait — count!

2673
02:10:39,750 --> 02:10:41,330
Oh, count! Wait!

2674
02:10:41,330 --> 02:10:45,800
Even so though!

2675
02:10:45,800 --> 02:10:47,520
Maybe Bonatan should go a little earlier?

2676
02:10:47,520 --> 02:10:53,290
Just now, it went up on 1-2-3-4.

2677
02:10:53,290 --> 02:10:55,070
Should we watch the timing?

2678
02:10:55,070 --> 02:10:56,870
Yeah, like—

2679
02:10:56,870 --> 02:11:01,870
After pressing the switch it lit up, then 1, 2, 3 — whoosh! — it came out.

2680
02:11:01,870 --> 02:11:03,770
Okay, so Unatan goes first.

2681
02:11:03,770 --> 02:11:04,370
Got it.

2682
02:11:04,370 --> 02:11:06,870
Here I go! Let's go!

2683
02:11:06,870 --> 02:11:09,470
Let's do it! Okay, button go!

2684
02:11:09,470 --> 02:11:17,310
Count — whoooosh!

2685
02:11:17,310 --> 02:11:17,810
Clang!

2686
02:11:17,810 --> 02:11:21,610
Oh! Got it! Amazing! Bonatan passed it 3 times!

2687
02:11:21,610 --> 02:11:23,610
And?

2688
02:11:23,610 --> 02:11:29,410
Bonatan got hit once — ow!

2689
02:11:29,410 --> 02:11:32,410
And?

2690
02:11:32,410 --> 02:11:36,210
I'm just kind of winging it — I'm winging it right now.

2691
02:11:36,210 --> 02:11:38,210
I was thinking about what we should do next.

2692
02:11:38,210 --> 02:11:43,210
That one also looks like it might launch something upward. Yeah, it does.

2693
02:11:43,210 --> 02:11:46,210
And it says "sea" on it too.

2694
02:11:46,210 --> 02:11:50,010
Number 1 is done. But we did 1 and 2 at the same time just now, right?

2695
02:11:50,010 --> 02:11:51,810
So that means...

2696
02:11:51,810 --> 02:11:58,810
Maybe these are just devices to get to that point, and we solve it somewhere around there?

2697
02:11:58,810 --> 02:12:02,610
Oh, maybe we use something for the laser? I'll bring it over here.

2698
02:12:02,610 --> 02:12:04,610
Yeah, bring it over. Okay.

2699
02:12:04,610 --> 02:12:09,010
Oh, there's something here.

2700
02:12:09,010 --> 02:12:10,010
Oh wait, it's right here.

2701
02:12:10,010 --> 02:12:11,810
Whoa, there it is!

2702
02:12:11,810 --> 02:12:12,610
But wait, what is it?

2703
02:12:12,610 --> 02:12:13,610
Did something change?

2704
02:12:13,610 --> 02:12:15,610
The fan slowed down.

2705
02:12:16,410 --> 02:12:18,410
It stopped!

2706
02:12:18,410 --> 02:12:21,210
Maybe we go over there now?

2707
02:12:21,210 --> 02:12:23,210
There's one here too, but—

2708
02:12:23,210 --> 02:12:26,010
—it's one you have to keep holding.

2709
02:12:26,010 --> 02:12:28,810
I see, so while you're holding it—

2710
02:12:28,810 --> 02:12:30,810
Let's go!

2711
02:12:30,810 --> 02:12:34,610
Oh, there's something here.

2712
02:12:34,610 --> 02:12:36,690
What is it?

2713
02:12:36,690 --> 02:12:39,330
Huh?

2714
02:12:39,330 --> 02:12:42,020
Shutdown.

2715
02:12:42,020 --> 02:12:45,020
There are two of us — can Popo come over here?

2716
02:12:45,820 --> 02:12:49,220
What are we supposed to do here?

2717
02:12:49,220 --> 02:12:52,360
Popo, if you put that down it'll start moving again, right?

2718
02:12:52,360 --> 02:12:53,260
Yeah, exactly.

2719
02:12:53,260 --> 02:12:56,530
But maybe it's fine now?

2720
02:12:56,530 --> 02:12:58,560
Maybe it's okay there now?

2721
02:12:58,560 --> 02:13:01,500
If you're in that room, you might be okay.

2722
02:13:01,500 --> 02:13:04,020
I'm turning on the fan, so hang on, Luna.

2723
02:13:04,020 --> 02:13:05,180
Okay!

2724
02:13:05,180 --> 02:13:09,960
I think you'll be fine as long as you stay in that room.

2725
02:13:09,960 --> 02:13:11,380
I'm in the room now.

2726
02:13:11,380 --> 02:13:13,340
Then maybe we can manage with a portal.

2727
02:13:13,340 --> 02:13:19,940
Oh, I'll connect a portal! It's here, Luna! There's a spot where I can place a portal!

2728
02:13:19,940 --> 02:13:21,740
What is it?

2729
02:13:21,740 --> 02:13:23,660
Come back here.

2730
02:13:23,660 --> 02:13:26,540
Okay, wait — if I go through here, will I disappear?

2731
02:13:26,540 --> 02:13:29,340
Yes! It'll stop in just a little bit.

2732
02:13:29,340 --> 02:13:32,470
Okay, and then?

2733
02:13:32,470 --> 02:13:34,270
How do I get back? How does this work?

2734
02:13:34,270 --> 02:13:36,070
Oh, you can't get back?

2735
02:13:36,070 --> 02:13:39,070
H-how do I get back over there?

2736
02:13:39,070 --> 02:13:40,670
What do I do?

2737
02:13:40,670 --> 02:13:42,470
Hmm...

2738
02:13:42,470 --> 02:13:44,270
A hole! Make a hole!

2739
02:13:44,270 --> 02:13:46,270
Huh? Is this... a hole?

2740
02:13:46,270 --> 02:13:50,010
I can't get back!

2741
02:13:50,010 --> 02:13:52,810
There's a hole here—

2742
02:13:52,810 --> 02:13:57,610
But Polka just randomly opened this one, so—

2743
02:13:57,610 --> 02:14:00,410
How is Luna going to—

2744
02:14:00,410 --> 02:14:02,210
Oh, Luna!

2745
02:14:02,210 --> 02:14:04,810
Ah— ah— ah— Luna!

2746
02:14:04,810 --> 02:14:09,610
Oh, go around! Go around! Go around!

2747
02:14:09,610 --> 02:14:12,410
Wait, is this a different code?

2748
02:14:12,410 --> 02:14:15,180
Fan shutdown.

2749
02:14:15,180 --> 02:14:17,010
I can't press it.

2750
02:14:17,010 --> 02:14:20,810
Fan shutdown? How do I press this?

2751
02:14:20,810 --> 02:14:23,610
Whoa, Luna, how's it going?

2752
02:14:23,610 --> 02:14:26,410
Do I do something on this side?

2753
02:14:26,410 --> 02:14:28,410
Even if I stop it, I still can't get back.

2754
02:14:28,410 --> 02:14:33,060
I'll aim the laser here.

2755
02:14:33,060 --> 02:14:36,380
I see, just once.

2756
02:14:36,380 --> 02:14:42,660
If you go through here, you'll disappear.

2757
02:14:42,660 --> 02:14:44,100
A laser through the portal?

2758
02:14:44,100 --> 02:14:48,260
Won't you disappear if you go through here?

2759
02:14:48,260 --> 02:14:51,400
The laser goes here.

2760
02:14:51,400 --> 02:14:53,620
A hole from here.

2761
02:14:53,620 --> 02:14:57,460
The laser passes through here.

2762
02:14:57,460 --> 02:15:02,960
Are you okay?

2763
02:15:02,960 --> 02:15:06,240
Laser.

2764
02:15:06,240 --> 02:15:08,860
Laser.

2765
02:15:08,860 --> 02:15:11,080
Polka, can you aim the laser this way?

2766
02:15:11,080 --> 02:15:12,660
Which way?

2767
02:15:12,660 --> 02:15:14,600
The side where the belly is.

2768
02:15:14,600 --> 02:15:18,240
The height might not be enough.

2769
02:15:18,240 --> 02:15:21,600
Not enough height?

2770
02:15:21,600 --> 02:15:24,500
Something like this, Polka—

2771
02:15:24,500 --> 02:15:28,460
Oh right, you can enter a portal you created, so probably—

2772
02:15:28,460 --> 02:15:33,310
If we can place the portal over there, we can get through.

2773
02:15:33,310 --> 02:15:40,880
Like, open it from this side, and then go like — whoosh!

2774
02:15:40,880 --> 02:15:42,400
Huh?

2775
02:15:42,400 --> 02:15:45,900
You can't enter the portal from that side, right?

2776
02:15:45,900 --> 02:15:49,460
And now it's going through the window again—

2777
02:15:49,460 --> 02:15:50,750
What?

2778
02:15:50,750 --> 02:15:54,120
How do we get there?

2779
02:15:54,120 --> 02:15:58,120
How did Luna even get over there?

2780
02:15:58,120 --> 02:16:03,440
Luna jumped from below—

2781
02:16:03,440 --> 02:16:07,040
That windmill — the volcano windmill—

2782
02:16:07,040 --> 02:16:11,040
She came flying in diagonally from the other side with momentum!

2783
02:16:11,040 --> 02:16:12,040
That's amazing.

2784
02:16:12,040 --> 02:16:15,840
She came through while it was stopped, right?

2785
02:16:15,840 --> 02:16:20,130
Wait, Polka, can you adjust the portal height? Seriously?

2786
02:16:20,130 --> 02:16:21,920
How do you do it?

2787
02:16:21,920 --> 02:16:24,730
You can change the portal height?

2788
02:16:24,730 --> 02:16:27,530
The portal height? Hold on a sec.

2789
02:16:27,530 --> 02:16:30,130
Hmm, how do I do this?

2790
02:16:30,130 --> 02:16:33,930
Can I aim the laser at the window?

2791
02:16:33,930 --> 02:16:39,930
The window — I can sort of change the height a little.

2792
02:16:39,930 --> 02:16:40,730
You can change it?

2793
02:16:40,730 --> 02:16:42,730
Can I do it from this side?

2794
02:16:46,330 --> 02:16:48,630
Was there another reflective surface somewhere here?

2795
02:16:48,630 --> 02:16:50,630
That one — Polka, the wall above Zed 1...

2796
02:16:50,630 --> 02:16:52,630
Wha!? What's that behind me!?

2797
02:16:52,630 --> 02:16:55,230
The laser is passing right through!

2798
02:16:55,230 --> 02:16:57,030
Luna, what should we do about this?

2799
02:16:57,030 --> 02:16:58,830
Where did it go?

2800
02:16:58,830 --> 02:17:00,830
I can't see you, Polka — I don't have eyes in the back of my head!

2801
02:17:00,830 --> 02:17:02,630
What's going on here?

2802
02:17:02,630 --> 02:17:06,230
Huh? Hmm… what's going on with that?

2803
02:17:06,230 --> 02:17:07,230
The top two…

2804
02:17:07,230 --> 02:17:09,230
Can we do any of them further ahead?

2805
02:17:09,230 --> 02:17:13,710
There…

2806
02:17:14,510 --> 02:17:15,870
Hmm…

2807
02:17:15,870 --> 02:17:17,700
Hmm…

2808
02:17:17,700 --> 02:17:22,080
That blue one from Popo's number two?

2809
02:17:22,080 --> 02:17:22,900
Yes

2810
02:17:22,900 --> 02:17:24,880
Oh, the 01's

2811
02:17:24,880 --> 02:17:27,460
Over there, um

2812
02:17:27,460 --> 02:17:30,160
Here

2813
02:17:30,160 --> 02:17:32,020
Here

2814
02:17:32,020 --> 02:17:35,280
Can you make it blue here? Do you know where I mean?

2815
02:17:35,280 --> 02:17:36,460
Where is it? Hold on

2816
02:17:36,460 --> 02:17:38,260
01 is that

2817
02:17:38,260 --> 02:17:40,060
Oh, here — the wall

2818
02:17:40,060 --> 02:17:40,660
This?

2819
02:17:40,660 --> 02:17:42,260
Yeah, yeah, exactly

2820
02:17:42,320 --> 02:17:47,120
Could you angle it a little more to the right?

2821
02:17:47,120 --> 02:17:51,120
The hole is a bit too close, or rather it's shifted to the left

2822
02:17:51,120 --> 02:17:53,230
Yeah yeah yeah yeah

2823
02:17:53,230 --> 02:18:00,170
Move the blue hole itself a little lower, or to the right

2824
02:18:00,170 --> 02:18:01,270
Here?

2825
02:18:01,270 --> 02:18:04,150
This angle is diagonal

2826
02:18:04,150 --> 02:18:10,110
Can you shoot it straight out this way?

2827
02:18:10,110 --> 02:18:12,110
This one?

2828
02:18:12,110 --> 02:18:13,910
Can't we do this?

2829
02:18:13,910 --> 02:18:27,810
It's on the left side, right?

2830
02:18:27,810 --> 02:18:30,600
We don't need the top, right?

2831
02:18:30,600 --> 02:18:33,400
As low a position as possible

2832
02:18:33,400 --> 02:18:35,200
Right?

2833
02:18:35,200 --> 02:18:38,000
Too low?

2834
02:18:38,000 --> 02:18:40,800
Too low? Higher would be better

2835
02:18:40,800 --> 02:18:42,560
Move the blue one up a bit

2836
02:18:42,560 --> 02:18:45,580
Can we shift the hole position a little more to the right?

2837
02:18:45,580 --> 02:18:49,920
Even if it moves, it won't go straight

2838
02:18:49,920 --> 02:18:51,320
The other thing is

2839
02:18:51,320 --> 02:18:52,100
A right angle

2840
02:18:52,100 --> 02:18:57,820
Can you make that laser reflector at a right angle?

2841
02:18:57,820 --> 02:18:58,880
Like this?

2842
02:18:58,880 --> 02:19:00,260
Oh, that's good, that's good

2843
02:19:00,260 --> 02:19:01,020
A little more to the left

2844
02:19:01,020 --> 02:19:02,560
Or right

2845
02:19:02,560 --> 02:19:03,140
Oh, that's good, that's good

2846
02:19:03,140 --> 02:19:03,980
Ow ow!

2847
02:19:03,980 --> 02:19:05,320
Here it comes!

2848
02:19:05,320 --> 02:19:07,220
Ow ow ow!

2849
02:19:07,220 --> 02:19:08,360
Here it comes, here it comes!

2850
02:19:08,360 --> 02:19:09,360
Ow ow ow ow!

2851
02:19:09,360 --> 02:19:20,320
Take it off? Okay. It's here! That's great! Hit it again! Hit it? Hit it? Don't? Don't? Hit it hit it hit it! Hitting it hitting it! Here it comes! What? Here it comes here it comes!

2852
02:19:20,320 --> 02:19:23,400
Did it get shot down?

2853
02:19:23,400 --> 02:19:25,380
Yes! Completely!

2854
02:19:25,380 --> 02:19:27,740
Whoa! It's gone!

2855
02:19:27,740 --> 02:19:29,640
Here it comes!

2856
02:19:29,640 --> 02:19:32,100
How do we get over there?

2857
02:19:33,240 --> 02:19:40,260
So, make a hole where you fell after jumping from number 1 earlier

2858
02:19:40,260 --> 02:19:43,600
Make a hole where you fell down from number 1?

2859
02:19:43,600 --> 02:19:47,120
Then make a hole here

2860
02:19:47,120 --> 02:19:50,610
And the momentum will carry you over here

2861
02:19:50,610 --> 02:19:51,790
Hopefully!

2862
02:19:51,790 --> 02:20:00,140
That's insane

2863
02:20:00,140 --> 02:20:00,880
Here it comes!

2864
02:20:00,880 --> 02:20:04,480
Like this, like this, like this, like this, like this

2865
02:20:04,480 --> 02:20:07,840
You're freaking out because the stage changed without any warning

2866
02:20:07,840 --> 02:20:08,920
For real

2867
02:20:08,920 --> 02:20:10,680
Wait, I think we open this one together

2868
02:20:10,680 --> 02:20:13,120
Okay, let's go — ready, go

2869
02:20:13,120 --> 02:20:14,880
Okay

2870
02:20:14,880 --> 02:20:17,340
Leave it there!

2871
02:20:17,340 --> 02:20:18,540
That's totally different

2872
02:20:18,540 --> 02:20:19,640
This is so L4D2

2873
02:20:19,640 --> 02:20:22,580
It's the same company, so I get it, but it really feels like L4D2

2874
02:20:22,580 --> 02:20:24,740
Popo noticed it — L4D2

2875
02:20:24,740 --> 02:20:26,880
Ready, go

2876
02:20:26,880 --> 02:20:28,880
Oh, it's telling us to insert the disc again

2877
02:20:28,880 --> 02:20:30,880
It says insert

2878
02:20:30,880 --> 02:20:32,680
What?

2879
02:20:32,680 --> 02:20:34,180
Like, a quest to find the disc?

2880
02:20:34,180 --> 02:20:34,680
Oh, there it is

2881
02:20:34,680 --> 02:20:35,680
Oh, it's there!

2882
02:20:35,680 --> 02:20:37,480
There it is, there it is, there it is!

2883
02:20:37,480 --> 02:20:45,880
Discovered a blueprint that's basically trash.

2884
02:20:45,880 --> 02:20:46,880
Such a tsundere!

2885
02:20:46,880 --> 02:20:49,680
Such a tsundere!

2886
02:20:49,680 --> 02:20:52,680
What a tsundere...

2887
02:20:55,280 --> 02:20:58,080
That guy does this every time.

2888
02:20:58,080 --> 02:21:00,080
Got disposed of again.

2889
02:21:00,080 --> 02:21:02,680
What a bunch of guys!

2890
02:21:02,680 --> 02:21:08,070
This feels pretty good, doesn't it?

2891
02:21:08,070 --> 02:21:11,870
We finished 2 of them, I think.

2892
02:21:11,870 --> 02:21:13,870
Ended at 0-1 and 0.

2893
02:21:13,870 --> 02:21:15,870
Hey hey hey hey, give me back my brain!

2894
02:21:15,870 --> 02:21:19,870
What kind of attack was that?!

2895
02:21:19,870 --> 02:21:23,670
So that's 2 done.

2896
02:21:23,670 --> 02:21:27,670
If there are already 2, I have no idea how many there are total.

2897
02:21:27,670 --> 02:21:29,470
They said there were quite a few.

2898
02:21:29,470 --> 02:21:30,470
Seriously?

2899
02:21:30,470 --> 02:21:31,470
How many are there?

2900
02:21:31,470 --> 02:21:32,270
I wonder how many there are?

2901
02:21:32,270 --> 02:21:33,270
10?

2902
02:21:33,270 --> 02:21:34,270
There are about 20.

2903
02:21:34,270 --> 02:21:37,440
20?!

2904
02:21:37,440 --> 02:21:38,440
Cute wink!

2905
02:21:38,440 --> 02:21:42,240
That wink is so cute!

2906
02:21:42,240 --> 02:21:47,220
So where's the next stage?

2907
02:21:47,220 --> 02:21:48,220
3?

2908
02:21:48,220 --> 02:21:51,020
It says... oh, there's a 4 but—

2909
02:21:52,060 --> 02:21:55,360
There's a 4 but no 3.

2910
02:21:55,360 --> 02:21:57,860
There's a 4, but...

2911
02:21:57,860 --> 02:22:00,660
3, 3, 3...

2912
02:22:00,660 --> 02:22:06,260
3, 3, 3...

2913
02:22:06,260 --> 02:22:08,560
Where's 3?

2914
02:22:08,560 --> 02:22:11,660
Is 3 above 2?

2915
02:22:11,660 --> 02:22:15,630
Whoa!

2916
02:22:15,630 --> 02:22:16,610
There's something written there.

2917
02:22:16,610 --> 02:22:18,430
That's 3!

2918
02:22:18,430 --> 02:22:20,230
Is there something in the middle?

2919
02:22:20,230 --> 02:22:22,230
Oh, there's a jump pad in the middle!

2920
02:22:22,230 --> 02:22:24,030
A jump pad?

2921
02:22:24,030 --> 02:22:26,830
But you can put a portal here.

2922
02:22:26,830 --> 02:22:30,430
Another jump?

2923
02:22:30,430 --> 02:22:33,230
That white thing—

2924
02:22:33,230 --> 02:22:37,060
Oh, there's one up top too.

2925
02:22:37,060 --> 02:22:40,220
Through the portal—

2926
02:22:40,220 --> 02:22:43,820
Oh, we made it!

2927
02:22:43,820 --> 02:22:47,670
Go this way, then this way—

2928
02:22:47,670 --> 02:22:53,850
Hard light bridge!

2929
02:22:53,850 --> 02:22:58,850
At this rate we'll just keep going with Luna.

2930
02:22:58,850 --> 02:23:05,510
Should we take a break? It's tough to decide — once you start you end up going all the way to 6.

2931
02:23:05,510 --> 02:23:12,570
You can do that or not, but I think you can only go full effort for about 2 of them.

2932
02:23:12,570 --> 02:23:18,370
Yeah. I think by the 3rd one you start getting tired. That's Polka's prediction.

2933
02:23:18,370 --> 02:23:21,170
Then let's stop here for today. Yeah, stopping here today.

2934
02:23:21,170 --> 02:23:26,970
Yeah. Alright. But now I finally get that there's still a lot more to play.

2935
02:23:26,970 --> 02:23:32,970
Yeah. Let's continue next time. Okay. Thank you, Luna!

2936
02:23:32,970 --> 02:23:36,770
Can we even save?

2937
02:23:36,770 --> 02:23:39,770
Not sure — I wonder how saving works in this game.

2938
02:23:39,770 --> 02:23:40,770
Can we save?

2939
02:23:40,770 --> 02:23:42,770
Is this auto-saving?

2940
02:23:42,770 --> 02:23:45,570
I'm so scared — is it saving properly?

2941
02:23:45,570 --> 02:23:48,570
It's saving, right? S-surely...

2942
02:23:48,570 --> 02:23:49,570
S-surely, right?

2943
02:23:49,570 --> 02:23:52,570
That loading screen earlier was fine, right?

2944
02:23:52,570 --> 02:23:54,430
It should be fine, yeah.

2945
02:23:54,430 --> 02:23:55,370
Alright, let's go.

2946
02:23:55,370 --> 02:23:58,370
Let's pick it up again next time.

2947
02:23:58,370 --> 02:24:01,370
Alright everyone, otsuporuna — that's it for today!

2948
02:24:01,370 --> 02:24:03,170
Okay~!

2949
02:24:03,170 --> 02:24:05,020
Ready, together—

2950
02:24:05,020 --> 02:24:08,940
Otsuporuna~!
